विसृज्य सशरं चापं शोकसंविग्न‍मानसः ॥ ४६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":429,\"bb\":389,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/46/b389/\",\"body_value\":\"sañjaya uvāca
evam uktvārjunaḥ saṅkhye
rathopastha upāviśat
visṛjya sa-śaraṁ cāpaṁ
śoka-saṁvigna-mānasaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":430,\"bb\":390,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/46/b390/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sañjayaḥ uvāca – Sañjaya said; evam – thus; uktvā – saying; arjunaḥ – Arjuna; saṅkhye – in the battlefield; ratha – of the chariot; upasthe – on the seat; upāviśat – sat down again; visṛjya – putting aside; sa-śaram – along with arrows; cāpam – the bow; śoka – by lamentation; saṁvigna – distressed; mānasaḥ – within the mind.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sañjayaḥ uvāca\",\"translation\":\"Sañjaya said\"},{\"word\":\"evam\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"uktvā\",\"translation\":\"saying\"},{\"word\":\"arjunaḥ\",\"translation\":\"Arjuna\"},{\"word\":\"saṅkhye\",\"translation\":\"in the battlefield\"},{\"word\":\"ratha\",\"translation\":\"of the chariot\"},{\"word\":\"upasthe\",\"translation\":\"on the seat\"},{\"word\":\"upāviśat\",\"translation\":\"sat down again\"},{\"word\":\"visṛjya\",\"translation\":\"putting aside\"},{\"word\":\"sa-śaram\",\"translation\":\"along with arrows\"},{\"word\":\"cāpam\",\"translation\":\"the bow\"},{\"word\":\"śoka\",\"translation\":\"by lamentation\"},{\"word\":\"saṁvigna\",\"translation\":\"distressed\"},{\"word\":\"mānasaḥ\",\"translation\":\"within the mind\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":431,\"bb\":391,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/46/b391/\",\"body_value\":\"Sañjaya said: Arjuna, having thus spoken on the battlefield, cast aside his bow and arrows and sat down on the chariot, his mind overwhelmed with grief.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":432,\"bb\":392,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/46/b392/\",\"body_value\":\"While observing the s